\newlabel{tab:closest}{{13}{14}{Row-wise setup comparison for the cited nearest work. Entries state the object and observation window, the schedule/measurement action, and the resulting contrast with this recorder audit, including whether each reports \emph {both} layers of our two-layer rule (a-priori reachability \emph {and} from-events magnitude). These scoped contrasts do not assert that an entire research area lacks schedule diagnostics or mechanism analysis}{table.13}{}}
